  "content": "\n\n<p>MalisisCore 是一個旨在協助開發模組的框架。涵蓋以下內容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>渲染</li>\n<li>動畫</li>\n<li>圖形使用者介面</li>\n<li>全新易用的背包管理系統</li>\n<li>ASM</li>\n<li>實體、物品等輔助類別</li>\n</ul>\n<p>目前為以下模組所需：<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2076338\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisDoors</a>.<br>目前為以下模組所需：<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2558284\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisBlocks</a>.<br>目前為以下模組所需：<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2599581\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisSwitches</a>.<br><span>目前為以下模組所需：<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2387403\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisAdvert</a></span><br>目前為以下模組所需：<span> <a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2222071\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Do It Yourself Decorative Blocks</a>.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若您願意，可以透過 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/ordinastie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://puu.sh/b8N4F.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\">Patreon</a> 支持我。</p>",
